    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Restoration of Favor"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A psalm of the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, you showed favor to your land;",
          "you restored the fortunes of Jacob. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You forgave your people’s guilt;",
          "you covered all their sin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You withdrew all your fury;",
          "you turned from your burning anger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Return to us, God of our salvation,",
          "and abandon your displeasure with us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will you be angry with us forever?",
          "Will you prolong your anger for all generations?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will you not revive us again",
          "so that your people may rejoice in you?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Show us your faithful love, Lord,",
          "and give us your salvation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will listen to what God will say;",
          "surely the Lord will declare peace",
          "to his people, his faithful ones,",
          "and not let them go back to foolish ways."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His salvation is very near those who fear him,",
          "so that glory may dwell in our land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Faithful love and truth will join together;",
          "righteousness and peace will embrace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Truth will spring up from the earth,",
          "and righteousness will look down from heaven."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Also, the Lord will provide what is good,",
          "and our land will yield its crops."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Righteousness will go before him",
          "to prepare the way for his steps."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
